# warnings

## INEFFECTIVE_DYNAMIC_IMPORT

```text
[INEFFECTIVE_DYNAMIC_IMPORT] lib.js is dynamically imported by main.js but also statically imported by main.js, dynamic import will not move module into another chunk.

```

# Assets

## main.js

```js
// HIDDEN [\0rolldown/runtime.js]
// lib.js
var lib_exports = /* @__PURE__ */ __exportAll({ x: () => 1 }, 2);
import * as import_node_path from "node:path";
__reExport(lib_exports, import_node_path);
const x = 1;
// main.js
const loaded = Promise.resolve().then(() => lib_exports);
export { loaded, x };

```
